<section data-name="Description and info 60/40" data-node-id="862:15935" data-role="split" data-layout="copy-first" data-variant="description"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I862:15935;756:1501" data-part="eyebrow">What it is</p>
<p data-node-id="I862:15935;756:1467" data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">It is a geodesic dome, [x] feet across, built on a platform above the river. Inside there is no furniture. There is a floor you lie down on, a sound system tuned to the shape of the room, and a ceiling that opens.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">Josh built it first and built the hotel around it.</p></div>
<div data-part="rate"><p data-node-id="I862:15935;756:1469" data-part="eyebrow">Day visitors</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I862:15935;756:1470" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Open by reservation</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 105.372 46.4" style="width:2.6343em"><use href="{base}/typography/0bd408815f0014b70974.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 45.801 46.4" style="width:1.145025em"><use href="{base}/typography/0bd408815f0014b70974.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 218.907 46.4" style="width:5.472675000000001em"><use href="{base}/typography/0bd408815f0014b70974.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
