<section data-name="Section - 50/50 image text" data-node-id="862:15937" data-role="split" data-layout="image-first" data-variant="editorial"><figure data-part="media" data-aspect="portrait"><img src="{base}/media/7625b812d3c4d8a8132d.webp" alt="The Frequency Dome" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="2400"></figure>
<div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="" data-part="eyebrow">Why a dome</p>
<h2 data-node-id="" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Geometry, not mysticism</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 206.075 46.4" style="width:5.1518749999999995em"><use href="{base}/typography/208090a30785ad094ac0.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 65.04 46.4" style="width:1.6260000000000001em"><use href="{base}/typography/208090a30785ad094ac0.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 196.719 46.4" style="width:4.917975em"><use href="{base}/typography/208090a30785ad094ac0.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">A dome is not a decorative choice. Sound behaves differently in a sphere than it does in a box. In a rectangular room, sound hits flat walls and bounces back at you in hard reflections. In a dome, the curve sends everything toward the center. You are lying in the place where it all arrives at once.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph">People describe it as sound coming from inside their body rather than from speakers, and that is not mysticism, it is geometry.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><a data-name="CTA" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/frequency-experience/">Book the Frequency Experience</a><a data-name="Link arrow button" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/the-vessyl-presents/">See what is on</a></div></div></section>
<section data-name="Hero text only" data-node-id="862:15938" data-role="text-hero"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I862:15938;764:945" data-part="eyebrow">What happens in there</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I862:15938;764:946" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Three things, mostly</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 112.774 46.4" style="width:2.81935em"><use href="{base}/typography/9ff4bc0aa26fffd665c9.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 126.7 46.4" style="width:3.1675em"><use href="{base}/typography/9ff4bc0aa26fffd665c9.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 130.352 46.4" style="width:3.2588em"><use href="{base}/typography/9ff4bc0aa26fffd665c9.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2></div></section>
<section data-name="3 col info" data-node-id="862:15939" data-role="facts"><div data-part="facts"><div data-part="fact"><h3 data-node-id="I862:15939;0" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Sound sessions</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 121.407 46.4" style="width:3.0351749999999997em"><use href="{base}/typography/db81e82102f11086f61a.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 161.387 46.4" style="width:4.034675em"><use href="{base}/typography/db81e82102f11086f61a.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h3>
<p data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">You lie on the floor for [x] minutes while someone plays live instruments and runs tracks through the system. Low frequencies you feel in your chest. No talking, no instruction, nothing you have to do correctly. Most people fall asleep at some point and that is fine.</p></div><div data-part="fact"><h3 data-node-id="I862:15939;1" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Movement and breath</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 206.016 46.4" style="width:5.150399999999999em"><use href="{base}/typography/d3455e3a3dd0b44a2304.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 69.415 46.4" style="width:1.7353750000000001em"><use href="{base}/typography/d3455e3a3dd0b44a2304.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 125.958 46.4" style="width:3.14895em"><use href="{base}/typography/d3455e3a3dd0b44a2304.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h3>
<p data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">Morning sessions, usually [x] minutes, [x] people maximum. Mats on the floor, facilitator in the room with you.</p></div><div data-part="fact"><h3 data-node-id="I862:15939;2" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Performance</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 249.747 46.4" style="width:6.2436750000000005em"><use href="{base}/typography/8a22329ab86f211e5cc0.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h3>
<p data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">When a musician is on the property, the Dome is where they play. The audience sits on the floor. There is no stage. See The Vessyl Presents for what is coming up.</p></div></div></section>
